  "description": "For the trails off the beaten track. Our ALLMTN 3 is an absolute all-rounder that can take on any terrain. The eFully comes with 160mm front and rear suspension travel, powerful four-piston disc brakes from Shimano and the powerful Yamaha PW-X3 drive – and is ready to experience all-mountain adventures at their best. Thanks to the mixed wheel sizes of 29″/27.5″ and the wide Continental Kryptotal tyres, you always enjoy perfect traction and master even the steepest uphills and downhills without any problems – no matter how rough the terrain is. Practical: with the Modular Rail System, you can mount accessories such as bags or a bottle cage on the bike. This gives you maximum flexibility on your adventures – even when you’re exploring trails off the beaten track.",
